			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750640412,
					"content": "噹噹！看吧，光與影的奇蹟！楓丹最新工業成果！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640413,
					"content": "這東西對我們來說已經不新鮮了！你還沒說要我們幫什麼忙耶？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640414,
						750640416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640414,
					"content": "請直說需要我們幫什麼忙吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640415,
					"content": "看樣子，一定是要我們幫忙拍照吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640418,
					"content": "哦哦…好吧，好的！這裡是你們的訂金，請先拿好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640419,
					"content": "這麼多錢！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640420,
					"content": "哇！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640421,
					"content": "正如你們所見，我需要拍幾張這裡本土龍類的畫片，不是那種動物圖鑑上的三視圖…不，我要的是那種更有生命力的畫片！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640422,
					"content": "嗯、嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640423,
					"content": "只是…唉，有生命力的東西未必願意聽我指揮。假如方便的話，或許身為冒險家的你們可以幫我拍出理想的畫片吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640424,
					"content": "嗯、嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640425,
					"content": "當然，假如超出你們能力範圍的話也不必勉強啦，不過我想你們至少可以保護我不被這附近的生物攻擊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640426,
					"content": "所以訂金請儘管留著吧——幫不幫忙就全看你們了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640427,
					"content": "哇啊…這麼多錢，沉甸甸的…我們真的可以留著嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640428,
					"content": "怎麼可能有半點假話！這點錢還需要我多加確認嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640429,
					"content": "哈！哈！那你算是找對人啦！我派蒙就是聞名全——納塔的馴龍大師！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640430,
					"content": "#沒問題，沒問題！只要有我和{NICKNAME}在，你想要什麼龍，我們都有辦法幫你馴服！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640431,
					"content": "嵴鋒龍？小意思！絨翼龍？太容易！暝視龍？簡簡單單！還有…呃，鰭游龍、匿葉龍、禿角龍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640432,
						750640433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640432,
					"content": "禿角龍？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640434
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640434,
					"content": "…大頭龍、小手龍、大眼龍、可怕龍、超可怕龍、不那麼可怕龍、奇奇怪怪龍、平平常常龍、乾乾瘦瘦龍、鼓鼓囊囊龍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640435,
					"content": "哼哼！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640436,
						750640437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640436,
					"content": "那都是些什麼啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640438
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640438,
					"content": "還有…嗷嗚嗷嗚龍！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640439,
					"content": "嗷嗚，嗷嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640440,
					"content": "哇呀哇呀龍！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640441,
					"content": "哇！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640442,
					"content": "反正、反正我們全都可以搞定！相信我，我們可是馴龍大師哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640443
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640443,
					"content": "嗯、嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640444,
						750640447
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640444,
					"content": "唉…我們會幫忙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640445
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640445,
					"content": "#都拿這麼多訂金了，我們會幫忙的啦！對不對，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640446
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640446,
					"content": "好耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640447,
					"content": "抱歉，我現在沒空。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640448
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640448,
					"content": "可是已經收訂金了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640449
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640449,
					"content": "哈，沒關係的，等你們下次有時間吧！我也不是非得要幫手不可就是了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750640437,
					"content": "停一下，妳聽聽自己在說什麼！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640438
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640433,
					"content": "等等…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640434
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640416,
					"content": "請給我錢，我會幫忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750640417,
					"content": "我們很酷，請先給錢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750640418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
